WEBVTT


00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.079
I thought this time you'd
be captured...


00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.639
or that I'd lose you.


00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.239
To whom?
Roma?


00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:17.968
To whom?
Roma?


00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:21.279
The disc which you gave the police?/
it's a fake.


00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.851
There was nothing in it.


00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.799
Don't worry sweetheart...


00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:31.443
Now I rule over the Asian underworld.
I am the King!


00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:36.799
It's been five years since that day.


00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:41.279
And I... Don... rule over the
Asian drug trade.


00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:42.719
The King.


00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:45.639
Now my target is Europe.


00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.319
The European drug cartel is aware that...


00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:50.559
I will takeover their market
by undercutting the prices.


00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.679
Once I establish my presence in Europe...


00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:55.319
they will be out of business.


00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.159
You speak to me like that again...


00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.162
I will have my man here slit your throat!


00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:00.199
How dare you speak to me...


00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.611
I speak the way I want.


00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:04.644
Gentlemen...


00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.079
gents...


00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.799
This is Jimmy Coogan...


00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:10.519
this cartel's boss.


00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.279
He has brought everyone together...


00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:14.639
so that they can set
aside their personal issues...


00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:18.167
and decide about my fate.


00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:21.563
All those in favour of killing Don?


00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:27.799
Very well then!


00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:31.486
I learnt about this meeting
a little late.


00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:19.480
Every heart is beating fast


00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:25.280
Guess who is here


00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.929
Don.


00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.519
Jaruwan says he is grateful
to see you at his door again.


00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.879
I'm not here for Jaruwan's door...


00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:58.201
but for my consignment.


00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.442
There goes your consignment.


00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.879
Damn!


00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.399
Now I'll have to drive the boat.


00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:11.290
You aren't going anywhere, Don.


00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:14.479
What brings about this hospitality?


00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.244
Jimmy Coogan.


00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.479
If we want to enter the
drug trade in Europe...


00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.799
your life is our ticket.


00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:25.439
And I guess he is the ticket collector.


00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:27.479
Hello big boy!


00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:29.239
Any last wish?


00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:32.879
Which restaurant in Bangkok
serves the best Italian meal?


00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:33.719
Meaning?


00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:38.720
Well, after killing all of you, I was
hoping to go for a good Italian dinner.


00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.599
You know, spaghetti bolognese,
a glass of red wine...


00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.399
No?
What?


00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.959
Nobody likes Italian?


00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.962
What a shame!/Shoot him!


00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.689
Quick! After him!


00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:46.370
See you around.


00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.919
Good evening/
Hi Roma!/Hi!


00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:44.323
Is this the file I'd asked for?I
YeslThanks.


00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.203
It's him!


00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:54.239
Any plans for tonight?I
Nothing, why?


00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:59.280
Because it's your birthday.
We should celebrate.


00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.921
My birthday?


00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:05.770
It's not my birthday today, Arjun.


00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:07.799
I know.


00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:10.690
Actually it's my birthday.


00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:18.800
Oh my God! I'm so sorry...
I completely forgot!


00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.599
Happy birthday, Arjun.


00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:21.959
Thanks.


00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:23.879
Just a second.


00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.450
Hello...


00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.843
I'll be right there.
Okay.


00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.686
Happy birthday/
Thank you.


00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:40.767
You wanted to see me, sir?I
Yes.


00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.402
Have a seat.


00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:49.928
Roma, do you know how long
I've served in this department?


00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:53.841
37 years.


00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:58.759
And in these 37 years
I've worked on 186 cases.


00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:02.685
I've worked with
very brave and able officers.


00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:09.248
But I know I'll miss you the most.


00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.399
I'm sorry, sir?


00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:17.199
I'm retiring, Roma/
What?


00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.719
Yes.


00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.803
I wanted to tell you myself.


00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:26.131
Come on, I'm not dying!


00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:32.239
Come...
walk me to my car.


00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:35.399
Sir... you could reconsider your decision...


00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:38.768
I don't want to/
What about Don?


00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.639
He is the only one who got away!


00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.359
He is your responsibility now.


00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:47.931
And I know you will do it.


00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:55.811
Good evening, Mr. Malik.


00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:56.959
Don?


00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.919
Put your hands up!
Up where I can see them.


00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.039
Take it easy guys...


00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.159
Down on your knees!


00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.879
Really? I'm wearing white!


00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:07.399
Shut up and get down on your knees.


00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:11.724
I am very happy to see you too,
my wild cat.


00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.928
Watch it!


00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:17.849
Why is every one so angry?


00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:21.039
Absolute immunity.


00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:23.839
Drop all charges against me.


00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:28.119
In Malaysia and in every country
where there's a warrant out for me.


00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.279
You're a wanted man in every country!


00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:34.045
How can I convince them all?I
Really?


00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:38.485
My mother would've been
so proud to hear that.


00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.599
Proud?


00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:43.559
She would've shot you herself!


00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:46.848
Mr. Malik, you didn't know my mother.


00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:50.407
Immunity or nothing!


00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:55.399
Don, that's impossible!


00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.719
I could probably save you
from the death penalty.


00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.319
That's all!


00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:03.159
The names of my clients,
my suppliers, every one involved...


00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.686
for all that information and evidence...


00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.004
your offer is quite small, Mr. Malik.


00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:12.079
Do something about it.
You know...


00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.599
Make me an offer I can't refuse.


00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.409
Okay.


00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:20.079
If you don't cooperate with us...


00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:25.883
Believe me, along with the prison term,
you'll also get the death penalty.


00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:30.165
We all die, Mr. Malik.


00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:35.690
Perhaps going to jail now
will be to my advantage.


00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:02.202
I've waited far too long for this day.


00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:06.879
How does it feel...
to be in prison?


00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:08.799
Yeah, it's okay.


00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:11.399
I'm unhappy with the
uniform colour...


00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:16.691
But you don't look happy either.
What is it?


00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:21.288
Your unexpected change of heart...


00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.799
why are you putting on this act?


00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:28.800
In this trade, when people covet
your death more than your life...


00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:32.602
it's understood that
it's time to move on.


00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.399
I figured I'd do something
good along the way but...


00:13:35.400 --> 00:13:40.239
you people didn't give me a chance.
Very sad!


00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.159
Had we given you that chance,


00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:45.319
you would've provided us
with the actual information...


00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:48.079
isn't that right?/
Yeah, that's right.


00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.759
I've lied to you once before...


00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:54.845
and I didn't like it/
Shut up!


00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:16.880
For once, I wanted to
see you behind bars...


00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:20.690
and now I have.


00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:24.444
So goodbye, Don!


00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:57.801
If you let me live,
it would be your biggest mistake.


00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.565
Welcome to hell, Don.


00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:50.485
Shower 14's drain is clogged.


00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:53.171
Inform housekeeping.


00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:01.527
Still upset?


00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.879
I'm here to offer my friendship.


00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:20.239
Let go of the past/
Let go of what??


00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:23.879
I've been trapped in this cage
for five years thanks to you!


00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:26.799
You're here because of your
ego, Vardhaan.


00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:29.929
You don't know how to change with
time and circumstance.


00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:34.159
Come on!


00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:35.559
Come on!


00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.528
Get up!


00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:42.079
If you know,
then what are you doing here?


00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:45.766
I've come here for you, Vardhaan.


00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.479
With an offer.


00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:51.280
Well, I have an offer too.


00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:56.879
How about I cut you to pieces and
feed you to the dogs in here?


00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:59.239
That will benefit neither you nor me,
Vardhaan.


00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.765
Only the dogs!


00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:05.681
And I hate dogs!


00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:08.719
I'm on death row, Vardhaan.


00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:12.479
Whether you kill me now
or the law does in two weeks...


00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.528
it's all the same.


00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.079
Think, Vardhaan!


00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:21.159
I could have surrendered
myself in any country...


00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.479
yet I chose this one.


00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:28.283
Though I know you are here,
eager to kill me.


00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.208
Don!


00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:51.450
Get out of here!
All of you... out!


00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.049
Go on...


00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:01.639
I've come to help you escape.


00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.291
In exchange for?


00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:05.479
You'll know when the time is right.


00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:07.323
No, no...


00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:10.279
You will tell me right now!


00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:15.280
All you need to do right now is to decide
whether you want to escape or not...


00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.439
If this is another of your tricks...


00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.807
Trust me, no tricks.


00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:23.319
What do I have to do?


00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:25.288
Good.


00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:30.931
Two days later, the kitchen supplies
are going to be delivered.


00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:57.599
You see him?


00:18:57.600 --> 00:19:00.319
I want that janitor's duty.
Pronto.


00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:04.450
Okay, but.../
Do it, please/Okay.


00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.639
Now what?


00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:24.359
Now we wait till Saturday.


00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:26.679
Why? What happens on Saturday?


00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:29.519
My attorney will pay me a visit.


00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:34.159
Any more questions?/
Yes, one more. May I ask?


00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:39.485
No! Got your answer?
Good night.


00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:32.321
Tonight we get out of here...
you ready?


00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:34.767
Oh yes!


00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.519
Hey, you want to eat my food?


00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:03.921
You don't want?/Hate fish!


00:22:13.800 --> 00:22:15.325
Help!


00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:17.919
He's dying, we need help here.


00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:18.959
He's dying.


00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:21.884
Thank you...
My friend is very sick.


00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:01.359
Hi...


00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:02.359
Hi.


00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:04.199
Hope I'm not disturbing you?


00:23:04.200 --> 00:23:06.248
No, not at all.


00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:10.319
Are those for me?


00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:11.924
Yeah!


00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:13.839
Thanks.


00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:16.889
Come in/Thanks.


00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:20.481
Who is this?


00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:24.324
My brother...
Ramesh.


00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:27.051
Your brother...


00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:30.288
Where is he?


00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:35.847
He's dead.


00:23:41.960 --> 00:23:43.325
I am sorry.


00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:45.368
That's okay.


00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:52.799
Roma, remember
you once told me that...


00:23:52.800 --> 00:23:57.522
you didn't want to think about anything
else till Don was arrested?


00:23:58.320 --> 00:24:00.129
I do.


00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:04.850
Well now the situation is...


00:24:09.640 --> 00:24:13.440
that your phone is ringing yet again.


00:24:14.160 --> 00:24:17.846
I am sorry... just a second...


00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:20.128
Hello?


00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:23.209
When?


00:24:57.960 --> 00:25:03.603
Mesmerising and alluring


00:25:05.480 --> 00:25:11.761
Is his magic


00:25:27.080 --> 00:25:32.610
Mesmerising and alluring


00:25:34.400 --> 00:25:40.362
Is his magic


00:25:40.920 --> 00:25:44.599
He whose eyes are stars


00:25:44.600 --> 00:25:47.479
He who is adorned with diamonds


00:25:47.480 --> 00:25:54.648
0 heart, is it true?


00:25:55.120 --> 00:25:58.519
O tell me


00:25:58.520 --> 00:26:01.679
He is here


00:26:01.680 --> 00:26:06.680
Hold on to your heart,
say it out loud


00:26:06.920 --> 00:26:10.439
Guess who it is


00:26:10.440 --> 00:26:15.440
He is here, once again


00:26:17.320 --> 00:26:21.086
Don


00:26:37.320 --> 00:26:42.963
I'm the mystery that no one gets


00:26:44.640 --> 00:26:50.727
My moves are above everyone else


00:27:05.800 --> 00:27:11.409
I'm the mystery that no one gets


00:27:13.240 --> 00:27:19.486
My moves are above everyone else


00:27:20.400 --> 00:27:24.079
I'm deeper than the ocean


00:27:24.080 --> 00:27:26.919
never standing still


00:27:26.920 --> 00:27:32.962
I'm denser than smoke


00:27:33.480 --> 00:27:38.480
that never stops rising


00:27:39.440 --> 00:27:44.440
Hold on to your heart,
say it out loud


00:27:44.680 --> 00:27:48.439
Guess who it is


00:27:48.440 --> 00:27:53.440
He is here, once again


00:27:55.000 --> 00:27:58.163
Don


00:28:20.120 --> 00:28:25.120
You aren't like smoke,
you are the flame


00:28:27.520 --> 00:28:32.520
If I come closer to you,
I'll burn and die


00:28:34.720 --> 00:28:38.599
if it's me you desire,
what else will you get?


00:28:38.600 --> 00:28:44.004
Where do I go next,
even I don't have a clue


00:28:44.160 --> 00:28:49.160
Hold on to your heart,
say it out loud


00:28:49.240 --> 00:28:52.879
Guess who it is


00:28:52.880 --> 00:28:57.880
He is here, once again


00:28:59.080 --> 00:29:01.560
Don


00:29:06.120 --> 00:29:09.488
Don


00:29:18.880 --> 00:29:23.090
Here! Now this is what
I want from you.


00:29:23.720 --> 00:29:26.799
There's a safety deposit box in
Zurich's Russian Commercial bank...


00:29:26.800 --> 00:29:30.199
that belonged to your ex-boss, Boris.


00:29:30.200 --> 00:29:35.200
He gave one of the set of keys to you and
the other to your partner, Singhania.


00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:37.681
I have one key, thanks to you.


00:29:37.800 --> 00:29:40.319
Come to think of it, if you had
taken the key from Singhania...


00:29:40.320 --> 00:29:43.799
either before poisoning him or even after,
it would've been to your advantage.


00:29:43.800 --> 00:29:46.041
What's in that box?


00:29:46.960 --> 00:29:50.399
You will know when we open it.


00:29:50.400 --> 00:29:53.688
Where is the key, Vardhaan?


00:29:56.240 --> 00:29:58.083
Zurich Airport.


00:29:58.160 --> 00:30:00.959
Baggage locker number 1-3-5.


00:30:00.960 --> 00:30:04.681
Combination lock number 5-4-8-1-7.


00:30:05.560 --> 00:30:07.639
Got ii.


00:30:07.640 --> 00:30:11.239
Sweetheart,
take the next flight out to Zurich.


00:30:11.240 --> 00:30:14.289
We'll see you there in two days.


00:30:15.720 --> 00:30:18.371
You trust this girl completely?


00:30:19.080 --> 00:30:20.570
Ayesha.


00:30:20.640 --> 00:30:22.449
Sorry?


00:30:23.160 --> 00:30:26.209
Ayesha, my name.


00:30:27.240 --> 00:30:28.719
You were saying...


00:30:28.720 --> 00:30:36.730
I was wondering if a girl like you
should do something as dangerous as this!


00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:40.891
I'm not just a pretty face,
Mr. Vardhaan.


00:30:41.200 --> 00:30:44.044
I have a lot of other skills too.


00:30:45.560 --> 00:30:46.799
See you in Zurich.


00:30:46.800 --> 00:30:48.643
See ya.


00:31:06.400 --> 00:31:08.687
Welcome to Zurich.


00:31:49.880 --> 00:31:52.531
Know him?


00:31:54.040 --> 00:31:56.039
Fabian Kohl.


00:31:56.040 --> 00:31:58.479
President of the German
Deutsch Zentral Bank.


00:31:58.480 --> 00:32:01.799
Influential, powerful and
respected by all.


00:32:01.800 --> 00:32:06.800
Not many know that the position
he has occupied for the past 8 years...


00:32:06.920 --> 00:32:10.839
was meant for someone else/
Who?


00:32:10.840 --> 00:32:13.519
When the committee was setup to
choose the bank's president...


00:32:13.520 --> 00:32:16.079
their first choice wasn't Kohl
but someone else.


00:32:16.080 --> 00:32:17.491
James Werden.


00:32:17.800 --> 00:32:20.319
So why didn't the
committee elect Werden?


00:32:20.320 --> 00:32:24.120
Werden was killed in a car accident.


00:32:26.240 --> 00:32:29.528
Kohl was behind that accident.


00:32:29.840 --> 00:32:33.003
Guess who helped him?


00:32:35.240 --> 00:32:36.799
Singhania?


00:32:36.800 --> 00:32:39.770
That's right, Vardhaan!


00:32:40.240 --> 00:32:43.719
But Kohl's messenger wasn't aware that...


00:32:43.720 --> 00:32:49.443
Singhania had recorded
their meeting in this tape.


00:32:50.000 --> 00:32:51.959
Are we going to blackmail Kohl?


00:32:51.960 --> 00:32:55.362
Yes and no.


00:32:55.560 --> 00:32:58.559
I will blackmail Kohl...


00:32:58.560 --> 00:33:03.282
through the bank's vice-president,
J. K. Diwan.


00:33:03.760 --> 00:33:07.119
The vice-president of DZB is an Indian?


00:33:07.120 --> 00:33:11.682
Well sweetheart,
we are everywhere.


00:33:12.320 --> 00:33:15.290
Why don't we deal with Kohl directly?


00:33:15.640 --> 00:33:20.479
A minister is more concerned about
power than the king himself.


00:33:20.480 --> 00:33:25.771
Kohl's messenger to Singhania
was none other than Diwan.


00:33:27.720 --> 00:33:29.768
What's on your mind?


00:33:32.560 --> 00:33:35.559
DZB has its currency centre here in Berlin.


00:33:35.560 --> 00:33:38.370
And that is where they print the
50 and 100 Euro bills.


00:33:38.880 --> 00:33:41.079
How much are we demanding?


00:33:41.080 --> 00:33:44.239
I don't want the money!!
Then what?


00:33:44.240 --> 00:33:49.240
I want the printing plates!


00:33:49.600 --> 00:33:52.319
Why on earth would Diwan
give us those plates?


00:33:52.320 --> 00:33:54.679
Blackmail or no blackmail,
he will be finished, right?


00:33:54.680 --> 00:33:55.799
Right!


00:33:55.800 --> 00:34:00.639
Therefore it's important to keep
Fabian Kohl and Diwan out of the picture.


00:34:00.640 --> 00:34:02.119
But how?


00:34:02.120 --> 00:34:08.241
With Diwan's help I'll break
into the currency centre.


00:34:13.480 --> 00:34:18.199
Even if you do steal the plates,
it's no big deal to make new ones.


00:34:18.200 --> 00:34:20.199
Of course it's no big deal, sweetheart.


00:34:20.200 --> 00:34:24.479
But new bills don't make
old ones worthless.


00:34:24.480 --> 00:34:27.119
By the time the bank
replaces every old bill...


00:34:27.120 --> 00:34:30.283
it will be years.


00:34:30.520 --> 00:34:32.839
By then... how should I say this...


00:34:32.840 --> 00:34:35.119
we will be...


00:34:35.120 --> 00:34:37.646
billionaires!


00:34:43.080 --> 00:34:48.080
Yes sir?IRoma, I just had a word
with German Interpol.


00:34:48.240 --> 00:34:51.439
Vardhaan and Don
were spotted in Zurich.


00:34:51.440 --> 00:34:53.839
Don and Vardhaan?


00:34:53.840 --> 00:34:55.759
What were they doing together?


00:34:55.760 --> 00:34:57.399
That's what we need to find out.


00:34:57.400 --> 00:35:01.199
The car they were travelling in
was found at a lonely spot in Berlin...


00:35:01.200 --> 00:35:03.851
Leave for Berlin immediately/
Right away, sir.


00:35:03.960 --> 00:35:07.399
I have spoken with the Director
of Intelligence, Klaus Wetland.


00:35:07.400 --> 00:35:11.079
He is attending a charity
fundraiser tomorrow/Right.


00:35:11.080 --> 00:35:17.201
He'll meet you there. All the best/
Okay, sir. Thank you!


00:35:30.400 --> 00:35:31.799
Excuse me, gentlemen...


00:35:31.800 --> 00:35:33.999
Mr. Wetland?
Roma Bhagat.


00:35:34.000 --> 00:35:37.279
Detective Malik may have
spoken to you about me/Yes, he did.


00:35:37.280 --> 00:35:39.079
This is Detective Jens Berkel.


00:35:39.080 --> 00:35:40.879
He will be working the case with you.


00:35:40.880 --> 00:35:43.281
Nice to meet you/
Pleased to meet you.


00:35:44.200 --> 00:35:48.119
Detective Malik wanted me to
personally thank you for all your help.


00:35:48.120 --> 00:35:50.919
Tell Malik, he owes me one.


00:35:50.920 --> 00:35:52.524
Big time!


00:35:53.200 --> 00:35:54.239
I will, sir.


00:35:54.240 --> 00:35:55.679
Good evening ladies and gentlemen.


00:35:55.680 --> 00:35:57.999
Thank you all for
being here with us today...


00:35:58.000 --> 00:36:01.527
and putting your heart
ahead of your wallet.


00:36:02.440 --> 00:36:05.079
Would you please join me
to welcome here today...


00:36:05.080 --> 00:36:06.439
our esteemed guest of honour...


00:36:06.440 --> 00:36:12.004
the Vice President of the DZB...
Mr. J.K. Diwan.


00:36:30.400 --> 00:36:34.239
We raise our glasses to your health.
Cheers!


00:36:34.240 --> 00:36:34.639
Cheers!


00:36:34.640 --> 00:36:36.639
Thank you ladies and gentlemen.


00:36:36.640 --> 00:36:39.291
Enjoy the rest of the evening.


00:37:10.320 --> 00:37:12.209
Thank you.


00:39:14.640 --> 00:39:16.608
What happened?


00:39:16.720 --> 00:39:18.609
That man...


00:39:19.160 --> 00:39:22.130
I don't know why but
I feel like I know him.


00:39:22.720 --> 00:39:24.879
Only if he didn't look like he did...


00:39:24.880 --> 00:39:27.042
I am sure...


00:39:28.800 --> 00:39:30.848
Find him, Arjun.


00:39:34.080 --> 00:39:36.639
It is extremely important because
if it wasn't for your support...


00:39:36.640 --> 00:39:39.559
we would never be able
to raise any funds.


00:39:39.560 --> 00:39:41.879
Your phone is ringing.


00:39:41.880 --> 00:39:44.042
My phone?/Yeah.


00:39:49.640 --> 00:39:51.559
Excuse me.


00:39:51.560 --> 00:39:52.559
Hello?


00:39:52.560 --> 00:39:52.639
Congratulations on the new phone,
Diwan.


00:39:52.640 --> 00:39:55.319
Congratulations on the new phone,
Diwan.


00:39:55.320 --> 00:39:59.530
The inbox has a video clip
which I'm sure you'll find interesting.


00:40:00.160 --> 00:40:05.690
I suggest you see it alone...
or it could prove embarrassing.


00:40:18.480 --> 00:40:21.079
I kept my word.


00:40:21.080 --> 00:40:22.239
Now it's your turn.


00:40:22.240 --> 00:40:24.799
Once Mr Werden
is elected as president...


00:40:24.800 --> 00:40:26.609
it will be difficult to make our move.


00:40:26.720 --> 00:40:29.291
Don't worry, it will be done.


00:40:33.240 --> 00:40:36.639
I told you it was interesting.


00:40:36.640 --> 00:40:39.799
Apart from this clip,
I also have a bank document.


00:40:39.800 --> 00:40:41.999
It states that a million
dollars were transferred...


00:40:42.000 --> 00:40:44.239
to Singhania's Swiss bank account.


00:40:44.240 --> 00:40:47.562
Singhania? I don't know any.../
Signed by you!


00:40:48.280 --> 00:40:51.479
It is your good fortune that
I am a nice guy.


00:40:51.480 --> 00:40:56.239
What I want is no big deal for you.


00:40:56.240 --> 00:40:59.959
There's a black car outside,
registration number BIU 103.


00:40:59.960 --> 00:41:02.039
You have...


00:41:02.040 --> 00:41:04.042
two minutes.


00:41:32.320 --> 00:41:34.129
Who are you?


00:41:44.800 --> 00:41:46.529
Don?


00:41:47.480 --> 00:41:49.881
No autographs please!


00:41:52.880 --> 00:41:56.239
Damn it! Get the car!


00:41:56.240 --> 00:41:57.639
You are crazy!


00:41:57.640 --> 00:41:59.399
Do you have any idea
what you're asking for?


00:41:59.400 --> 00:42:00.319
Of course.


00:42:00.320 --> 00:42:02.799
I want the information that will help me


00:42:02.800 --> 00:42:05.201
get inside the underground
vault of the DZB.


00:42:05.720 --> 00:42:07.399
Listen... if you want money...


00:42:07.400 --> 00:42:08.959
please just name your amount,
you will get it.


00:42:08.960 --> 00:42:10.999
What you're asking for is impossible.


00:42:11.000 --> 00:42:16.404
Would you and Fabian Kohl rather spend
the rest of your lives in prison?


00:42:18.080 --> 00:42:21.279
The details of what I want
are on the phone.


00:42:21.280 --> 00:42:22.964
And Diwan...


00:42:23.280 --> 00:42:26.204
You have 24 hours.


00:42:43.960 --> 00:42:46.042
Roma! There!


00:42:57.480 --> 00:43:00.962
I see you... my wild cat.


00:43:04.000 --> 00:43:04.799
Don!


00:43:04.800 --> 00:43:07.531
If I'm caught with you...IRelax Diwan.


00:43:07.640 --> 00:43:09.799
It is not just difficult to catch Don...


00:43:09.800 --> 00:43:11.928
it's impossible!


00:45:08.480 --> 00:45:10.559
Are you alright?


00:45:10.560 --> 00:45:12.479
Everybody okay?


00:45:12.480 --> 00:45:14.369
Step aside sir.


00:45:14.800 --> 00:45:17.399
Police business.
Step away from the car!


00:45:17.400 --> 00:45:20.370
It's my car...


00:45:24.680 --> 00:45:28.207
Get out! Please!


00:45:31.560 --> 00:45:34.166
Got any money?


00:45:36.680 --> 00:45:38.569
There he is.


00:46:24.720 --> 00:46:27.239
Times up, sorry Roma.


00:46:27.240 --> 00:46:29.368
See you soon.


00:47:11.320 --> 00:47:12.559
Hello.


00:47:12.560 --> 00:47:14.767
A moment please sir.


00:47:15.000 --> 00:47:17.844
Sorry, I have to go.


00:47:20.600 --> 00:47:23.001
This will destroy us.


00:47:23.680 --> 00:47:26.359
Do what ever you have to do Diwan.


00:47:26.360 --> 00:47:30.922
I don't want to hear about that man,
Don, ever again.


00:47:31.200 --> 00:47:33.487
Is that understood?


00:48:10.080 --> 00:48:12.159
So Mr. Diwan...


00:48:12.160 --> 00:48:15.209
how can Abdul Jabbar
be of assistance?


00:48:17.360 --> 00:48:19.761
I've heard you are a useful man.


00:48:22.160 --> 00:48:24.447
You've heard right.


00:48:24.960 --> 00:48:26.799
What's the job?


00:48:26.800 --> 00:48:29.119
You know of Don, of course?


00:48:29.120 --> 00:48:30.399
Hmm...


00:48:30.400 --> 00:48:32.799
He is in Berlin right now.


00:48:32.800 --> 00:48:35.929
I want you to trace him down and...


00:48:36.320 --> 00:48:37.845
you know...


00:48:46.960 --> 00:48:48.769
Why?


00:48:49.960 --> 00:48:52.719
Why do you want him killed,
Mr. Diwan?


00:48:52.720 --> 00:48:56.281
You need reason or money?


00:49:00.720 --> 00:49:03.451
Now you're talking!


00:49:07.160 --> 00:49:09.367
Five million Euro.


00:49:09.480 --> 00:49:11.079
Half now and...


00:49:11.080 --> 00:49:14.641
the rest when I hand you his head.


00:49:14.800 --> 00:49:16.879
That's not necessary.


00:49:16.880 --> 00:49:22.569
I want it done.
As soon as possible!


00:49:34.320 --> 00:49:36.119
Vardhaan!


00:49:36.120 --> 00:49:40.639
Now do you see why
we never get along?


00:49:40.640 --> 00:49:41.959
It would be better if instead
of watching cartoons...


00:49:41.960 --> 00:49:45.599
you were thinking about
the security at the DZB.


00:49:45.600 --> 00:49:46.719
Really?


00:49:46.720 --> 00:49:48.999
Even if Diwan does help...


00:49:49.000 --> 00:49:51.479
stealing those plates from the DZB
won't be a cakewalk.


00:49:51.480 --> 00:49:54.119
I know, Vardhaan.


00:49:54.120 --> 00:49:57.919
We need a computer hacker to control
the building's security system.


00:49:57.920 --> 00:50:01.447
My remote, please.


00:50:02.320 --> 00:50:03.919
Thank you!


00:50:03.920 --> 00:50:05.239
But who?


00:50:05.240 --> 00:50:07.999
All our useful men are
either in prison or...


00:50:08.000 --> 00:50:10.002
on the FBI and Interpol watch list.


00:50:10.600 --> 00:50:12.519
Relax Vardhaan.


00:50:12.520 --> 00:50:17.686
I know just the guy for this task.


00:50:21.400 --> 00:50:23.239
Hey! Watch out!!
Are you crazy?


00:50:23.240 --> 00:50:24.844
Sorry!


00:50:36.800 --> 00:50:38.079
Thank you for coming, Sameer.


00:50:38.080 --> 00:50:39.719
Not at all, sir, please... I mean...


00:50:39.720 --> 00:50:44.079
I had to see for myself that
it really was you who called.


00:50:44.080 --> 00:50:47.004
I'm just a big fan, sir/
Sir?


00:50:47.120 --> 00:50:49.479
That sounds too 'honest'.


00:50:49.480 --> 00:50:52.962
Call me Don.
I have a job for you.


00:50:55.400 --> 00:50:58.119
The security system at the
DZB's currency centre...


00:50:58.120 --> 00:51:00.959
is controlled by a master computer.


00:51:00.960 --> 00:51:02.959
I want you to hack into this computer...


00:51:02.960 --> 00:51:07.284
so that it's under my control.


00:51:11.640 --> 00:51:15.565
I'm really sorry sir... Don.


00:51:15.800 --> 00:51:17.399
I don't think I can do itl
Really?


00:51:17.400 --> 00:51:20.799
Is it the SameerAli who at 17 hacked
into the Tokyo Stock Exchange and...


00:51:20.800 --> 00:51:22.719
stole 1.4 million dollars?


00:51:22.720 --> 00:51:25.879
And then donated it anonymously
to 'Save the Oceans' foundation.


00:51:25.880 --> 00:51:28.850
There's nothing to prove that I did it.


00:51:29.080 --> 00:51:32.368
And if there's no evidence,
you aren't guilty.


00:51:32.640 --> 00:51:34.479
Isn't that right?


00:51:34.480 --> 00:51:36.209
Touché!


00:51:37.800 --> 00:51:41.399
You've been quite low key
the past three years.


00:51:41.400 --> 00:51:42.719
I'm sure love has something to do with it.


00:51:42.720 --> 00:51:47.601
Actually tell me... I like love stories.


00:51:48.000 --> 00:51:49.968
She is a...


00:51:50.080 --> 00:51:51.959
she's very special.


00:51:51.960 --> 00:51:54.079
I am sure she is.


00:51:54.080 --> 00:51:56.559
But so is your talent.


00:51:56.560 --> 00:52:01.600
It would be a shame
not to put it to use at right time.


00:52:03.240 --> 00:52:04.969
I can't.


00:52:05.600 --> 00:52:11.562
I promised Yana that
I won't do anything illegal.


00:52:12.160 --> 00:52:17.929
If there's no evidence,
you aren't guilty, right?


00:52:33.000 --> 00:52:34.843
Hey...


00:52:36.280 --> 00:52:38.239
where were you?


00:52:38.240 --> 00:52:40.119
I had the interview, remember?


00:52:40.120 --> 00:52:43.841
Oh yeah, how did it go?


00:52:44.080 --> 00:52:46.731
I got the job, Yana.


00:52:48.840 --> 00:52:51.366
That's great, Sam.


00:52:53.440 --> 00:52:55.841
How are you feeling?


00:52:56.000 --> 00:52:58.082
I feel good.


00:52:58.280 --> 00:53:00.599
A little bit tired... but good.


00:53:00.600 --> 00:53:02.479
He's not troubling you too much, is he?


00:53:02.480 --> 00:53:06.690
No. He's very well behaved.


00:54:03.800 --> 00:54:05.559
At 1:18pm...


00:54:05.560 --> 00:54:07.767
there are two people in the car.


00:54:09.680 --> 00:54:11.799
Exactly 6 minutes later...


00:54:11.800 --> 00:54:14.644
Here, look carefully.


00:54:16.360 --> 00:54:17.879
Only one!


00:54:17.880 --> 00:54:20.479
That means the passenger got off...


00:54:20.480 --> 00:54:23.399
somewhere between Tiergarten Strasse...


00:54:23.400 --> 00:54:27.639
and 17th Juli Strasse.


00:54:27.640 --> 00:54:31.361
Probably someone saw
him get out of the car.


00:54:32.240 --> 00:54:34.719
Possible.


00:54:34.720 --> 00:54:36.399
I'll talk to Berkel.


00:54:36.400 --> 00:54:40.405
If there's a witness,
we'll find him.


00:54:44.840 --> 00:54:45.639
Hello...


00:54:45.640 --> 00:54:50.248
Diwan, I'm sure you are
impressed by my punctuality.


00:54:50.640 --> 00:54:52.159
So, what have you decided?


00:54:52.160 --> 00:54:54.839
I'm willing to give you what you want.


00:54:54.840 --> 00:54:56.079
Good.


00:54:56.080 --> 00:55:00.051
Tomorrow morning at 8,
outside the Berlin Cathedral.


00:55:03.640 --> 00:55:04.639
Now what?


00:55:04.640 --> 00:55:06.759
You will do exactly as he wants you to.


00:55:06.760 --> 00:55:08.888
What do you mean?


00:55:09.400 --> 00:55:11.919
I can't give him that information!


00:55:11.920 --> 00:55:14.207
Who said it has to be real?


00:55:14.400 --> 00:55:18.199
By the time Don figures it out...


00:55:18.200 --> 00:55:20.601
He will be dead, Mr. Diwan.


00:55:34.080 --> 00:55:35.079
Hello?


00:55:35.080 --> 00:55:38.559
A sightseeing bus
is approaching from your left.


00:55:38.560 --> 00:55:39.686
I see it.


00:55:39.760 --> 00:55:42.439
It will stop in front of you.


00:55:42.440 --> 00:55:45.250
Come to the upper deck!


00:55:52.240 --> 00:55:54.049
Let's go.


00:56:13.000 --> 00:56:17.688
Everything you've asked for
is in these discs.


00:56:21.040 --> 00:56:24.639
The blueprints of the currency centre,
security protocols and...


00:56:24.640 --> 00:56:26.959
all codes to access the building.


00:56:26.960 --> 00:56:29.479
What about the safe
containing the plates?


00:56:29.480 --> 00:56:34.439
That safe is in the underground vault.


00:56:34.440 --> 00:56:37.079
It can only be opened by a passkey...


00:56:37.080 --> 00:56:41.119
which is in the custody of the centre's
chief technician, Dr. Schneider.


00:56:41.120 --> 00:56:43.122
Anything else?


00:56:44.240 --> 00:56:46.639
Apart from the passkey,
the safe also requires...


00:56:46.640 --> 00:56:51.202
Dr. Schneider's fingerprints
and voice match.


00:56:57.200 --> 00:56:59.719
Look honestly,
you've got to trust me.


00:56:59.720 --> 00:57:01.879
I'm telling you the truth.


00:57:01.880 --> 00:57:04.167
You have beautiful eyes...


00:57:04.280 --> 00:57:06.248
I trust you.


00:57:09.720 --> 00:57:11.399
Keep this phone on you.


00:57:11.400 --> 00:57:13.999
You have a reservation
at the Hotel de Rome.


00:57:14.000 --> 00:57:16.999
Stay there until my next call.


00:57:17.000 --> 00:57:20.159
But what about the tape
and documents?


00:57:20.160 --> 00:57:22.639
Relax Diwan.


00:57:22.640 --> 00:57:26.531
You'll get what you deserve.


00:58:28.400 --> 00:58:30.607
Take the stairs.


00:58:42.880 --> 00:58:46.168
Karl, you stay here/
Yeah.


01:00:43.640 --> 01:00:45.165
You!!


01:00:53.160 --> 01:00:55.128
Jabbar...


01:00:55.440 --> 01:00:58.879
Don may not keep
in touch with his friends...


01:00:58.880 --> 01:01:02.282
but he always checks on his enemies.


01:01:14.920 --> 01:01:16.879
Someone is following you, sir.


01:01:16.880 --> 01:01:19.042
Thanks, Sameer.


01:01:19.440 --> 01:01:21.239
You want this, right?


01:01:21.240 --> 01:01:23.163
No, Don.


01:01:23.280 --> 01:01:26.284
I want to kill you.


01:01:28.040 --> 01:01:29.879
We seem to have a problem.


01:01:29.880 --> 01:01:31.439
You see...


01:01:31.440 --> 01:01:34.519
I prefer to stay alive.


01:01:34.520 --> 01:01:38.844
I think you'll have
to change your intention.


01:01:39.800 --> 01:01:43.479
I suggest you join with me.


01:01:43.480 --> 01:01:46.759
Whatever money
Diwan has promised you...


01:01:46.760 --> 01:01:49.445
I'll give you three times more.


01:01:50.240 --> 01:01:52.288
Think about it.


01:01:52.840 --> 01:01:55.684
I don't want to put you...


01:01:56.640 --> 01:01:59.211
under any pressure!


01:02:07.120 --> 01:02:08.239
We found someone.


01:02:08.240 --> 01:02:09.199
That's great!


01:02:09.200 --> 01:02:11.919
Someone at the station
has identified Don's car.


01:02:11.920 --> 01:02:14.599
And he also got a good look
at the person who got out.


01:02:14.600 --> 01:02:16.079
Super! Where is he?


01:02:16.080 --> 01:02:17.039
He's with the sketch artist.


01:02:17.040 --> 01:02:19.439
Okay, let me know
when the sketch is complete.


01:02:19.440 --> 01:02:20.719
Alright then.


01:02:20.720 --> 01:02:22.370
Arjun!


01:02:23.200 --> 01:02:24.479
Good job.


01:02:24.480 --> 01:02:26.209
Thanks.


