I'd like to speak with Roma, please.


01:29:27.560 --> 01:29:30.159
How do you know...


01:29:30.160 --> 01:29:32.719
Oh my God!


01:29:32.720 --> 01:29:35.719
God won't come here, Mr. Malik.


01:29:35.720 --> 01:29:37.799
He is in the building.


01:29:37.800 --> 01:29:38.999
Let me talk to Roma.


01:29:39.000 --> 01:29:41.765
He wants to talk to you.


01:29:43.400 --> 01:29:44.719
Hello?


01:29:44.720 --> 01:29:48.088
Roma, Roma...


01:29:48.400 --> 01:29:51.119
you aren't giving up, are you?


01:29:51.120 --> 01:29:55.842
People might think you still love me.


01:29:56.600 --> 01:29:57.879
What do you want?


01:29:57.880 --> 01:30:00.799
I'd like to give you a last chance.


01:30:00.800 --> 01:30:03.559
I want you to drop
all charges against me.


01:30:03.560 --> 01:30:05.719
You've already seen one explosion.


01:30:05.720 --> 01:30:10.319
I can set off other
explosions around the building.


01:30:10.320 --> 01:30:15.320
And seeing you so close
to me is suffocating me.


01:30:15.880 --> 01:30:18.399
So everybody...
move back a little please!


01:30:18.400 --> 01:30:19.359
What is he saying?


01:30:19.360 --> 01:30:20.719
If we don't move our men back...


01:30:20.720 --> 01:30:22.529
he is going to detonate another
explosive.


01:30:22.640 --> 01:30:25.479
He's bluffing!/No, I am not.


01:30:25.480 --> 01:30:29.799
Roma, tell Commissioner Mueller to take
a look at the fire truck in front of him.


01:30:29.800 --> 01:30:34.522
In 30 seconds it'll blow up.


01:30:35.640 --> 01:30:36.639
Damn it!


01:30:36.640 --> 01:30:39.962
Move all your men back,
we have only 30 seconds.


01:31:19.880 --> 01:31:20.639
What?


01:31:20.640 --> 01:31:21.959
Hello...


01:31:21.960 --> 01:31:25.119
is it me you're looking for...


01:31:25.120 --> 01:31:28.647
What do you want?/
My wild cat...


01:31:28.840 --> 01:31:32.119
Anybody comes within
100 feet of this building and...


01:31:32.120 --> 01:31:34.691
I'll set off more explosions.


01:31:35.080 --> 01:31:39.319
Understood?I
Yes.


01:31:39.320 --> 01:31:43.879
I'm watching all of you,
especially you...


01:31:43.880 --> 01:31:47.799
so no tricks please. And get this
damn helicopter to buzz off!


01:31:47.800 --> 01:31:50.959
It's spoiling the mood, sweetheart.


01:31:50.960 --> 01:31:53.361
Don!


01:31:54.080 --> 01:31:56.003
Damn it!


01:32:06.360 --> 01:32:10.331
The cops are going to be busy
deciding their next strategy.


01:32:11.480 --> 01:32:14.639
Are all our men in position?IYes.


01:32:14.640 --> 01:32:18.439
And the bombs?/They're ready.
Exactly where you wanted them.


01:32:18.440 --> 01:32:22.570
Very good.
Let's get to work.


01:33:07.880 --> 01:33:10.884
The gas will be effective
in the chamber for 3 minutes.


01:33:12.120 --> 01:33:13.770
I leave the rest to you.


01:33:59.360 --> 01:34:01.599
Sam, password?


01:34:01.600 --> 01:34:06.367
83675U9


01:34:31.640 --> 01:34:33.404
Alarm activated.


01:34:35.480 --> 01:34:36.879
Come on!


01:34:36.880 --> 01:34:38.803
Get out of there.


01:34:44.240 --> 01:34:46.839
That was close!/Yeah!


01:34:46.840 --> 01:34:51.239
Where are the plates?/
You think I'd leave without them?


01:34:51.240 --> 01:34:54.642
All good. Pass me the bag please.


01:34:56.960 --> 01:34:58.928
Thank you.


01:35:04.520 --> 01:35:05.439
Sam?


01:35:05.440 --> 01:35:06.919
Yes?


01:35:06.920 --> 01:35:09.651
Time to go!IGot it.


01:35:21.120 --> 01:35:25.808
I told you I will never forget
what you did to me.


01:35:26.160 --> 01:35:29.084
Even so you trusted me.


01:35:30.400 --> 01:35:32.641
Plates, please...


01:35:38.480 --> 01:35:40.528
Bag.


01:35:43.200 --> 01:35:46.170
Not very smart, are you?


01:35:50.960 --> 01:35:54.319
You wanted to leave me
behind to die, huh?


01:35:54.320 --> 01:35:57.159
Death will come, Don.


01:35:57.160 --> 01:35:59.279
Not for me...


01:35:59.280 --> 01:36:01.567
But you!


01:36:02.960 --> 01:36:07.960
Jabbar, if you kill me
how do you plan on escaping?


01:36:09.880 --> 01:36:11.999
What do you mean?ll mean...


01:36:12.000 --> 01:36:14.519
There is neither a service exit
in the basement...


01:36:14.520 --> 01:36:17.439
...nor is Ayesha waiting
in a police van.


01:36:17.440 --> 01:36:23.561
You see...l didn't have an
escape plan for you at all.


01:36:27.840 --> 01:36:30.199
Jabbar! That's a lie!


01:36:30.200 --> 01:36:33.919
How did he plan on getting away
if he didn't have an escape plan?


01:36:33.920 --> 01:36:35.959
Vardhaan...


01:36:35.960 --> 01:36:39.885
Perhaps you weren't paying attention.


01:36:40.280 --> 01:36:45.446
I didn't have an
escape plan for 'you'.


01:36:46.680 --> 01:36:49.799
You think you can get away from us?


01:36:49.800 --> 01:36:55.728
Remember, Sameer said he couldn't
control the electric supply in the vault?


01:36:56.800 --> 01:36:59.041
He was lying.


01:37:00.800 --> 01:37:01.999
Hey!


01:37:02.000 --> 01:37:04.810
What are you doing?/Nothing.


01:37:07.560 --> 01:37:11.451
Karl? Karl? What's going on?


01:37:21.680 --> 01:37:24.047
Shocking behaviour, dude!


01:37:32.640 --> 01:37:35.484
Find Don! Go!


01:37:36.800 --> 01:37:39.839
Perfect timing, Sam/Thanks.


01:37:39.840 --> 01:37:42.889
See you outside. Switching off.


01:37:52.960 --> 01:37:54.919
Good day/Good day.


01:37:54.920 --> 01:37:57.924
Could you deliver this urgently.


01:39:59.480 --> 01:40:01.319
Hello, Officer...


01:40:01.320 --> 01:40:04.164
Listen to me very carefully.


01:40:26.080 --> 01:40:29.289
So, ready to go.


01:40:30.080 --> 01:40:31.445
Yeah...


01:40:32.320 --> 01:40:33.446
Ready.


01:40:36.960 --> 01:40:38.371
Thanks.


01:40:40.560 --> 01:40:41.846
Drop the gun.


01:40:42.680 --> 01:40:45.126
I said drop the gun!


01:40:46.480 --> 01:40:48.244
Drop the gun.


01:40:53.400 --> 01:40:55.687
Hands on your head!


01:41:03.720 --> 01:41:05.839
You are under arrest, Don!


01:41:05.840 --> 01:41:09.765
You got mell did.


01:41:10.120 --> 01:41:12.088
Cuffs.


01:41:13.000 --> 01:41:15.207
Hands behind you.


01:41:17.000 --> 01:41:21.085
Ooh... kinky!


01:41:22.480 --> 01:41:24.639
Glad you like it.


01:41:24.640 --> 01:41:27.610
Because they aren't coming off!


01:41:29.480 --> 01:41:32.370
It's over, Don.


01:41:32.840 --> 01:41:37.840
Where are your partners?I
You may search my pockets.


01:41:38.520 --> 01:41:40.639
Where are they?


01:41:40.640 --> 01:41:43.439
They aren't my partners... any more,
Mr. Malik.


01:41:43.440 --> 01:41:46.319
What do you mean?ll mean...


01:41:46.320 --> 01:41:51.804
Vardhaan controls them now, not me.


01:41:52.920 --> 01:41:55.279
Vardhaan is in the building?


01:41:55.280 --> 01:41:58.759
Vardhaan, Abdul Jabbar and his goons.


01:41:58.760 --> 01:42:03.288
They are a dangerous bunch...
Be careful.


01:42:04.840 --> 01:42:06.968
Come on.


01:42:09.000 --> 01:42:11.679
So you let your heart
overcome your mind.


01:42:11.680 --> 01:42:13.762
Very sad.


01:42:14.120 --> 01:42:17.159
It was a momentary lapse
of judgment but...


01:42:17.160 --> 01:42:21.719
I realised I'm not like you/
You definitely are not!


01:42:21.720 --> 01:42:24.079
I have along life ahead of me...


01:42:24.080 --> 01:42:26.639
Whereas you and Yana
don't have a future.


01:42:26.640 --> 01:42:29.959
Stop it! Take him away!


01:42:29.960 --> 01:42:31.564
Stay!


01:42:39.640 --> 01:42:42.479
I'd like to speak to the
officer-in-charge.


01:42:42.480 --> 01:42:44.399
Vardhaan...


01:42:44.400 --> 01:42:47.279
it's coming from inside
the building, sir.


01:42:47.280 --> 01:42:49.439
Give it to me.


01:42:49.440 --> 01:42:51.199
Detective Malik here.


01:42:51.200 --> 01:42:53.559
Hello Malik?


01:42:53.560 --> 01:42:55.119
Vardhaan.


01:42:55.120 --> 01:42:57.359
You better surrender, Vardhaan.


01:42:57.360 --> 01:42:59.279
Why?


01:42:59.280 --> 01:43:01.039
I have 25 of DZB's staff as hostages...


01:43:01.040 --> 01:43:05.719
And you know I won't hesitate
in killing them.


01:43:05.720 --> 01:43:09.519
You are already in a mess,
don't try anything stupid.


01:43:09.520 --> 01:43:10.839
No, no...


01:43:10.840 --> 01:43:14.319
You'll be stupid to ignore my words.


01:43:14.320 --> 01:43:18.079
In two hours I need a helicopter
that will take us to the airport.


01:43:18.080 --> 01:43:20.879
And I need a plane waiting for us.


01:43:20.880 --> 01:43:24.359
When we reach our destination,
I will set the hostages free.


01:43:24.360 --> 01:43:26.239
Is that clear, Malik?


01:43:26.240 --> 01:43:28.599
That's not possible.


01:43:28.600 --> 01:43:31.524
Really?


01:43:32.560 --> 01:43:34.847
Jabbar!


01:43:39.400 --> 01:43:41.482
Vardhaan!


01:43:42.480 --> 01:43:43.919
You hear that?


01:43:43.920 --> 01:43:46.479
If firing into air can have that effect...


01:43:46.480 --> 01:43:50.959
Imagine if I had to shoot one of them.


01:43:50.960 --> 01:43:52.962
Two hours.


01:43:59.040 --> 01:44:02.519
Do you know
how Don exited the building?


01:44:02.520 --> 01:44:07.970
No, really sorry. I was in touch with him
till he got out of the vault.


01:44:13.520 --> 01:44:16.888
What was he doing in the vault?


01:44:17.840 --> 01:44:20.279
So Sameer confessed everything?


01:44:20.280 --> 01:44:23.919
Answer me...Where are the plates?


01:44:23.920 --> 01:44:25.879
Vardhaan has the plates.


01:44:25.880 --> 01:44:28.929
How did you get out of the building?


01:44:33.120 --> 01:44:36.479
Answer my question, Don!!
Why should I tell you?


01:44:36.480 --> 01:44:41.239
The hostages could die because of you.


01:44:41.240 --> 01:44:44.599
I regret this is happening,
Mr. Malik.


01:44:44.600 --> 01:44:49.600
But if you want my help,
then I want something in return too.


01:44:49.720 --> 01:44:53.039
You are in no position to negotiate.


01:44:53.040 --> 01:44:58.365
Well in that case...
I'd like to talk to Mr. Diwan.


01:45:00.040 --> 01:45:02.079
Why?


01:45:02.080 --> 01:45:07.962
I think he will empathize with me.


01:45:11.600 --> 01:45:12.999
It's quite simple.


01:45:13.000 --> 01:45:16.079
If I go to prison,
so do you and Fabian Kohl.


01:45:16.080 --> 01:45:18.560
Look you can't...


01:45:20.840 --> 01:45:25.759
Please look...Look we had a deal.
I gave you everything you asked for!


01:45:25.760 --> 01:45:30.607
Trust me, this is my last request.
Promise.


01:45:37.160 --> 01:45:38.969
He will help us.


01:45:39.160 --> 01:45:43.559
Mr. Diwan has promised me immunity
here in Germany.


01:45:43.560 --> 01:45:47.690
For some reason, I trust him.


01:45:48.360 --> 01:45:53.360
In return, I'll help diffuse the bombs
and free the hostages.


01:45:54.600 --> 01:45:56.479
What about the plates?


01:45:56.480 --> 01:45:59.839
Don't worry.
You'll get the plates back.


01:45:59.840 --> 01:46:02.279
Roma...


01:46:02.280 --> 01:46:03.799
What?


01:46:03.800 --> 01:46:08.800
I want you to believe that
this change of heart isn't an act...


01:46:09.200 --> 01:46:13.759
and as a show of good faith,
I'm ready to deliver the discs to you...


01:46:13.760 --> 01:46:18.760
...which will put an end to the
drug trade in Europe and Asia.


01:46:20.880 --> 01:46:23.360
Really?


01:46:27.800 --> 01:46:29.559
Roma, strange isn't it?


01:46:29.560 --> 01:46:33.119
Once again life has brought us together.


01:46:33.120 --> 01:46:36.239
You and I can never be together.


01:46:36.240 --> 01:46:38.129
You never know.


01:46:40.360 --> 01:46:45.360
Perhaps someday you'll realise that I'm
no longer the same Don that you despise.


01:46:45.800 --> 01:46:50.806
Though a dog may straighten its tail,
it is still a dog.


01:46:52.240 --> 01:46:56.599
No wonder I can't let go of you,
my wild cat.


01:46:56.600 --> 01:46:59.365
What? Are you going to shoot me?


01:46:59.840 --> 01:47:03.287
Don't tempt me.


01:47:05.640 --> 01:47:07.688
Let's go.


01:47:08.960 --> 01:47:11.519
Roma, please...
do you really need to do this?


01:47:11.520 --> 01:47:13.090
Yes, I do!/\Nhy?


01:47:13.720 --> 01:47:17.399
The S.E.K unit can do the job.../
Will you just relax?


01:47:17.400 --> 01:47:21.166
Stay with Mr. Malik, got it?


01:47:22.520 --> 01:47:25.799
If anything happens to her, I will...


01:47:25.800 --> 01:47:29.930
You will...What'?


01:47:34.960 --> 01:47:38.567
Your team is very concerned
about each other.


01:47:39.160 --> 01:47:41.288
Sweet!


01:47:46.640 --> 01:47:49.610
Gentlemen... enjoy the swim.


01:47:57.840 --> 01:48:00.879
Where's Don?/Forget him!


01:48:00.880 --> 01:48:04.282
If he wants to live,
he won't come back.


01:48:07.680 --> 01:48:09.599
Okay, which way now?


01:48:09.600 --> 01:48:11.648
Follow me.


01:48:19.200 --> 01:48:22.488
So, what's the deal
between you and... Arjun?


01:48:23.640 --> 01:48:26.159
It doesn't concern you.


01:48:26.160 --> 01:48:29.319
Thought we'd catch up.
Is that wrong?


01:48:29.320 --> 01:48:33.999
You? Besides yourself, you are incapable
of thinking about anything.


01:48:34.000 --> 01:48:36.082
And you.


01:48:46.600 --> 01:48:49.285
You guys take cover
behind the door.


01:48:51.120 --> 01:48:53.851
Herman, go.


01:49:12.080 --> 01:49:13.730
Roma.


01:49:14.720 --> 01:49:16.159
What?


01:49:16.160 --> 01:49:20.559
When I said, I was ready
to give the police the disc...


01:49:20.560 --> 01:49:23.325
How did you feel?


01:49:29.600 --> 01:49:33.079
Your words no longer
have an effect on me.


01:49:33.080 --> 01:49:38.080
I know...but still you were surprised.


01:49:38.320 --> 01:49:42.799
Roma, the fact is I'm tired of my life.


01:49:42.800 --> 01:49:47.119
Now I loathe people like
Vardhaan and Coogan.


01:49:47.120 --> 01:49:51.119
I want to be free from them
and the law.


01:49:51.120 --> 01:49:54.761
I want to be a free man.


01:49:57.080 --> 01:49:59.651
Please...


01:50:00.360 --> 01:50:03.319
Forgive me, Roma.


01:50:03.320 --> 01:50:05.766
Come on, we are clear.


01:50:25.080 --> 01:50:27.159
Wait Roma.


01:50:27.160 --> 01:50:28.679
There are security cameras outside.


01:50:28.680 --> 01:50:32.319
Jabbar's goons can monitor
everything in the surveillance room.


01:50:32.320 --> 01:50:34.368
This was your brilliant plan?


01:50:35.080 --> 01:50:37.799
I had planted one bomb
in the there so that...


01:50:37.800 --> 01:50:41.486
...we could destroy
all evidence as we escape.


01:50:57.440 --> 01:50:58.399
Karl!


01:50:58.400 --> 01:50:59.919
Check where the blast happened.


01:50:59.920 --> 01:51:01.639
All positions... report in.


01:51:01.640 --> 01:51:04.530
Position 1, all clear/
Position 2, all clear.


01:51:05.720 --> 01:51:08.644
Position 3 come in...


01:51:08.920 --> 01:51:10.922
Position 3?


01:51:12.480 --> 01:51:14.050
Ladies first.


01:51:17.480 --> 01:51:19.721
Position 3?


01:51:21.320 --> 01:51:24.244
No reply from the
surveillance room, Jabbar.


01:51:27.400 --> 01:51:28.845
Don!


01:51:30.080 --> 01:51:31.719
Karl...


01:51:31.720 --> 01:51:33.599
Bring me his head.


01:51:33.600 --> 01:51:35.762
Ulrich! Sven!


01:51:48.800 --> 01:51:51.531
Sven and Ulrich are dead.


01:54:10.360 --> 01:54:11.519
You're welcome.


01:54:11.520 --> 01:54:12.851
You're welcome.


01:54:14.320 --> 01:54:16.279
You are shot.


01:54:16.280 --> 01:54:18.439
Merely grazed me.


01:54:18.440 --> 01:54:20.799
Sorry/You okay?


01:54:20.800 --> 01:54:23.159
We're good.


01:54:23.160 --> 01:54:25.879
Stay down.
I'm going to check on the others.


01:54:25.880 --> 01:54:28.679
May I ask you something?


01:54:28.680 --> 01:54:30.199
Yeah.


01:54:30.200 --> 01:54:33.966
What's the deal between you
and Arjun?


01:54:34.880 --> 01:54:37.611
He likes you.


01:54:39.080 --> 01:54:43.439
It's not difficult to understand
why he likes you.


01:54:43.440 --> 01:54:45.199
And you...


01:54:45.200 --> 01:54:47.519
Do you like him?


01:54:47.520 --> 01:54:52.359
I don't need to answer anything.


01:54:52.360 --> 01:54:57.079
You know what I think?
You don't like him...


01:54:57.080 --> 01:55:00.319
...because you still love me.


01:55:00.320 --> 01:55:03.239
I don't love you.


01:55:03.240 --> 01:55:05.799
Just checking!


01:55:05.800 --> 01:55:08.879
Herman's dead.
And the bomb is still armed.


01:55:08.880 --> 01:55:10.919
Karl, can you hear me?


01:55:10.920 --> 01:55:13.479
Karl, come in...


01:55:13.480 --> 01:55:15.926
Ulrich... come in...God Damn it!


01:55:16.600 --> 01:55:18.039
Something is wrong.


01:55:18.040 --> 01:55:21.759
Jabbarmdetonate the bombs.


01:55:21.760 --> 01:55:26.607
Let them know how it feels
to mess with us!


01:55:35.680 --> 01:55:38.286
Try the other one!


01:55:48.000 --> 01:55:50.079
It's not working...


01:55:50.080 --> 01:55:52.890
Jabbar...


01:55:59.480 --> 01:56:00.799
Let her go, please!


01:56:00.800 --> 01:56:03.201
Please don't kill her!


01:56:05.600 --> 01:56:07.319
Malik!


01:56:07.320 --> 01:56:11.719
If the helicopter isn't here in 5 minutes.
This poor woman will lose her life.


01:56:11.720 --> 01:56:13.119
Vardhaan...


01:56:13.120 --> 01:56:15.879
2 hours aren't up yet.
20 minutes to go.


01:56:15.880 --> 01:56:18.199
You're lying, Malik.


01:56:18.200 --> 01:56:20.399
When I throw this woman's body
out of the window...


01:56:20.400 --> 01:56:24.799
...you'll know we weren't lying.


01:56:24.800 --> 01:56:26.799
Jabbar, don't!


01:56:26.800 --> 01:56:29.159
The police didn't betray you, I did.


01:56:29.160 --> 01:56:33.319
Let the woman go.
I'm coming there.


01:56:33.320 --> 01:56:37.519
Vardhaan, the helicopter
has left the airbase.


01:56:37.520 --> 01:56:40.159
It will be here in ten minutes.


01:56:40.160 --> 01:56:45.166
Trust me! If you shoot,
I won't be able to help you.


01:56:46.200 --> 01:56:48.719
Ten minutes, Malik!


01:56:48.720 --> 01:56:50.959
Don...


01:56:50.960 --> 01:56:55.568
Come here right now!


01:56:58.720 --> 01:57:00.719
Just a second.


01:57:00.720 --> 01:57:03.959
Philip needs medical help.
I think you should stay with him.


01:57:03.960 --> 01:57:06.599
I'm going with Don, okay?/
Good luck.


01:57:06.600 --> 01:57:08.079
Thanks.


01:57:08.080 --> 01:57:10.519
Roma, what are you doing?
It's not safe for you.


01:57:10.520 --> 01:57:12.959
That woman needs me.


01:57:12.960 --> 01:57:15.439
But it's too dangerous.
Vardhaan and Jabbar can't be trusted.


01:57:15.440 --> 01:57:18.719
It's my duty to get those hostages out.
So, come on..


01:57:18.720 --> 01:57:21.719
Try to understand, Roma!


01:57:21.720 --> 01:57:25.361
If something were to happen to you...


01:57:28.160 --> 01:57:30.999
I'm coming with you.


01:57:31.000 --> 01:57:34.641
That's it. Let's go.


01:57:43.200 --> 01:57:45.519
Well, well, well!


01:57:45.520 --> 01:57:48.205
What a happy reunion!


01:57:48.520 --> 01:57:49.959
Hello, Roma.


01:57:49.960 --> 01:57:52.839
Your weapons on the floor.


01:57:52.840 --> 01:57:56.526
I mean really!
Do I need to spell it out?


01:58:01.960 --> 01:58:05.601
Please remove your bullet proof vest.


01:58:09.000 --> 01:58:11.199
Vardhaan, the police is giving you
everything you asked for.


01:58:11.200 --> 01:58:15.519
In return, at least let the women go.


01:58:15.520 --> 01:58:17.399
No, not a chance.


01:58:17.400 --> 01:58:22.400
I've realised that women are...
more useful in these situations.


01:58:24.440 --> 01:58:27.719
If we must let someone go...


01:58:27.720 --> 01:58:30.079
Let it be Don.


01:58:30.080 --> 01:58:32.799
Sorry?/Don't be!


01:58:32.800 --> 01:58:37.279
I want to kill Don and so does Jabbar.


01:58:37.280 --> 01:58:42.239
And I'm sure you won't regret
if he is killed. Right?


01:58:42.240 --> 01:58:44.129
Right?


01:58:46.560 --> 01:58:49.245
Give her the gun.


01:59:01.000 --> 01:59:03.287
Good.


01:59:03.840 --> 01:59:06.519
Now...


01:59:06.520 --> 01:59:09.683
...kill him.


01:59:18.800 --> 01:59:21.439
Amazing!


01:59:21.440 --> 01:59:24.762
Now I've seen it all.


01:59:25.400 --> 01:59:28.609
You seem to have cast
a spell on her, Don. SCRATCH


01:59:28.880 --> 01:59:30.530
Anyway...


01:59:31.800 --> 01:59:36.800
Let's try again. Jabbar!


01:59:36.880 --> 01:59:41.880
If she doesn't shoot Don
by the time I count three...


01:59:42.000 --> 01:59:45.049
Shoot her!


01:59:48.720 --> 01:59:51.200
One...


01:59:52.080 --> 01:59:53.599
Pull the trigger, Roma.


01:59:53.600 --> 01:59:55.479
Two...


01:59:55.480 --> 01:59:58.086
Shoot me, Roma!


02:00:00.000 --> 02:00:03.288
Three!/Do it!


02:00:29.520 --> 02:00:33.047
So, both of you were under a spell.


02:00:37.400 --> 02:00:40.239
You're next, Don.


02:00:40.240 --> 02:00:42.639
Vardhaan, you seem to forget something.


02:00:42.640 --> 02:00:43.879
What's that?


02:00:43.880 --> 02:00:47.599
Before Don's enemy
can make his first move...


02:00:47.600 --> 02:00:51.764
Don has made his next move!


02:02:20.360 --> 02:02:22.039
Is everybody okay?/Thank you!


02:02:22.040 --> 02:02:27.046
No. Not yet.
Stay right there! Please!


02:02:28.960 --> 02:02:30.928
Mr. Nlalik?


02:02:32.160 --> 02:02:33.519
Malik here.


02:02:33.520 --> 02:02:38.119
Mr. Malik, Jabbar is dead.
And you won't have any issue...


02:02:38.120 --> 02:02:41.359
...in taking Vardhaan back to prison.


02:02:41.360 --> 02:02:44.039
The plates and hostages are with me.


02:02:44.040 --> 02:02:45.999
So now...


02:02:46.000 --> 02:02:50.608
I hope you have the papers
for my immunity.


02:02:52.160 --> 02:02:55.479
We have the papers/
Very good, Mr. Malik.


02:02:55.480 --> 02:02:58.051
Send them in...


02:02:58.960 --> 02:03:01.319
With Sameer!


02:03:01.320 --> 02:03:08.841
Sameer?/I want to see that traitor
one last time.


02:03:32.480 --> 02:03:35.039
She's alive.


02:03:35.040 --> 02:03:37.611
Bring the file here.


02:03:47.240 --> 02:03:49.846
Let him go! Now!


02:03:50.000 --> 02:03:53.239
You better find a safe hiding place.


02:03:53.240 --> 02:03:57.239
Because the day I find you...
you'll be dead!


02:03:57.240 --> 02:04:00.528
You know where I live,
drop in any time.


02:04:01.520 --> 02:04:04.759
Of course! I know where you live.


02:04:04.760 --> 02:04:07.764
Drop the weapon. Right now!


02:04:25.680 --> 02:04:27.444
That's him.


02:04:29.360 --> 02:04:31.931
What happened to Roma?


02:04:37.320 --> 02:04:39.607
Yours I believe...


02:04:40.560 --> 02:04:43.404
Do take care of her.


02:04:44.040 --> 02:04:46.281
Here! Hurry!


02:04:53.600 --> 02:04:55.359
Gentlemen...


02:04:55.360 --> 02:05:00.159
is there anything else I can do for you?/
Where is the disc?


02:05:00.160 --> 02:05:05.160
In the bag with the plates.
Can I leave now?


02:05:06.160 --> 02:05:09.839
Once I check the disc...I
Of course.


02:05:09.840 --> 02:05:15.529
And how long will that take?


02:05:17.400 --> 02:05:19.926
Take him away!


02:05:20.160 --> 02:05:22.527
Good night, everyone.


02:05:24.800 --> 02:05:27.326
Thank you.


02:06:06.800 --> 02:06:08.848
Check this out!


02:06:11.960 --> 02:06:13.679
What about these plates,
Mr. Diwan?


02:06:13.680 --> 02:06:15.728
I'll take them.


02:06:16.080 --> 02:06:18.924
They need to be checked for damages.


02:06:25.480 --> 02:06:30.088
Is it good?IGood?
It's priceless, Mr. Malik.


02:06:30.920 --> 02:06:34.719
You want Mr Kohl to become president,
he will be the president.


02:06:34.720 --> 02:06:36.319
That's my responsibility, Mr. Diwan.


02:06:36.320 --> 02:06:38.527
Oh my God!


02:06:55.600 --> 02:06:57.319
Remember I said...


02:06:57.320 --> 02:07:04.169
'Don's enemies should always remember
that Don never forgets]


02:07:08.000 --> 02:07:12.119
The people who wanted to get rid of me,
are themselves in the docks now.


02:07:12.120 --> 02:07:14.639
Jimmy Coogan, you are under arrest.


02:07:14.640 --> 02:07:20.170
Jimmy Coogan and all his ilk.


02:07:21.960 --> 02:07:26.159
The police had to accept that it was


02:07:26.160 --> 02:07:30.290
because of my help that
Fabian Kohl was exposed.


02:07:31.240 --> 02:07:36.280
Vardhaan got back
to where he belonged.


02:07:39.160 --> 02:07:45.042
Now to take care of one last thing.


02:07:48.240 --> 02:07:49.799
Yes?/Package for Mr. Ali?


02:07:49.800 --> 02:07:53.282
Yes, that's me/
Please sign here, sir.


02:07:54.560 --> 02:07:56.050
Here you go.


02:07:57.320 --> 02:07:59.322
Thanks/Bye.


02:08:12.880 --> 02:08:13.719
Hello?


02:08:13.720 --> 02:08:15.879
Don.


02:08:15.880 --> 02:08:18.770
I sent you a present.


02:08:19.720 --> 02:08:23.122
I hope you like it.


02:09:11.560 --> 02:09:14.803
I missed you sweetheart.


02:09:20.560 --> 02:09:22.799
Where is he?


02:09:22.800 --> 02:09:25.087
He's right here.


02:09:31.160 --> 02:09:35.519
When I get out of the DZB,
hand me over to the police.


02:09:35.520 --> 02:09:37.921
Sorry?


02:09:38.240 --> 02:09:42.119
Don't worry. it's part of the plan.


02:09:42.120 --> 02:09:45.761
This disc has all the
information and details.


02:09:47.320 --> 02:09:51.689
Here's what I want you to do with it.


02:09:57.120 --> 02:09:59.441
Check this out.


02:10:03.800 --> 02:10:07.088
The perfect crime!


02:10:08.920 --> 02:10:10.649
Plates please...


02:10:43.560 --> 02:10:45.801
Thanks/Bye.


02:10:46.560 --> 02:10:49.199
Everybody thinks the real plates
were destroyed in the blast.


02:10:49.200 --> 02:10:54.764
But here they are with me.


02:11:17.640 --> 02:11:19.519
Now what?


02:11:19.520 --> 02:11:22.719
My enemies are either dead
or in prison.


02:11:22.720 --> 02:11:27.720
And the police have nothing on me.
So now...


02:11:27.760 --> 02:11:31.287
Now... I am a free man!


02:11:32.720 --> 02:11:34.799
What about Roma?


02:11:34.800 --> 02:11:37.690
Why did you have to save her life?


02:11:39.880 --> 02:11:42.639
Roma is like a bad habit.


02:11:42.640 --> 02:11:45.041
And it's not easy to give up a habit.


02:11:46.480 --> 02:11:48.959
Forget about her sweetheart.


02:11:48.960 --> 02:11:51.879
Imagine how rich we're going to be!


02:11:51.880 --> 02:11:53.279
Really!


02:11:53.280 --> 02:11:56.204
I still can't believe you got out alive.


02:11:58.560 --> 02:12:01.719
Remember this...


02:12:01.720 --> 02:12:06.442
It's not just difficult to catch Don...
